{\b What this installs}\par
\bullet\tab Redoubt, the interface and on-demand scanner.\par
\bullet\tab A background service providing real-time scanning and ransomware detection.\par
\bullet\tab A script-scanning provider that Windows loads into PowerShell, Office and .NET so scripts can be checked before they run.\par\par
Redoubt installs in {\b observe mode}: it reports what it finds and does not quarantine or delete anything until you turn that on yourself.\par\par
Removing Redoubt leaves your signature database, logs and quarantined files in place under ProgramData.\par}